---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Correct a to-do: title, due, amount, counterparty or kind, as field=value. The row is yours from then on

Usage: mxr todo edit [OPTIONS] <TODO_ID> <FIELD=VALUE>...

Arguments:
  <TODO_ID>
  <FIELD=VALUE>...

Options:
      --dry-run
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
